<file path="plans/role-generate-a-structural-sequential-thacker.md">
# Structural Design Plan: Developer Portfolio Landing Page (1440px Dark Mode)

## Context

Building a developer portfolio landing page from a clean-slate React + Vite + Tailwind v4 project. The brief prescribes all design tokens, typography, section hierarchy, and layout logic. The goal is a disciplined dark-mode engineering portfolio at 1440px — no gradients, no glow, no soft shadows, 8px grid, amber accent used only for CTAs and active states.

---

## Global Tokens

Wire all tokens as CSS custom properties in `src/index.css`, mapped into Tailwind v4 via `@theme`:

```css
/* src/index.css — font imports first */
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@700&display=swap');
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap');
@import 'tailwindcss';

:root {
  --color-bg:       #0C0D10;
  --color-surface:  #17181B;
  --color-border:   #2A2C31;
  --color-accent:   #D3992D;
  --color-text1:    #EDE9E1;
  --color-text2:    #8D897F;
  --color-green:    #3DD68C; /* terminal dot / open-to-work indicator */
}

@theme {
  --color-bg:       var(--color-bg);
  --color-surface:  var(--color-surface);
  --color-border:   var(--color-border);
  --color-accent:   var(--color-accent);
  --color-text1:    var(--color-text1);
  --color-text2:    var(--color-text2);
  --color-green:    var(--color-green);
  --font-display:   'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
  --font-mono:      'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  --font-body:      'Inter', sans-serif;
  --radius-card:    4px;
}
```

**Self-check rule:** every color in JSX must trace to one of these seven token names. No raw hex in component files.

---

## File / Component Structure

```
src/
  App.tsx                   ← imports all sections, sets bg-bg baseline
  index.css                 ← tokens, font imports, global resets (no * reset)
  components/
    Nav.tsx
    Hero.tsx
    About.tsx
    Process.tsx             ← compressed Tier 3 (3-step tracker row)
    Projects.tsx
    SkillsMatrix.tsx
    ContactFooter.tsx
```

All components are default exports. `App.tsx` renders them in order inside a single `<main>` with `bg-bg text-text1 font-body`.

---

## Section Plans

### NAV — Sticky, 72px, `z-50`

**Layout:** `fixed top-0 inset-x-0 h-18 border-b border-border bg-bg/95 backdrop-blur-sm`
- Left cluster: `font-mono text-accent text-sm "[DEV/]"` + `font-display text-text1 "Alex Chen"` — flex gap-3 items-center
- Center/Right nav links: `font-mono text-sm lowercase text-text2` with `hover:text-text1` transitions; active page gets `text-accent underline underline-offset-4`
- Far right: outlined button `border border-border text-text1 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-mono hover:border-accent hover:text-accent` — "Resume"
- Behaviour: `position: sticky` via Tailwind; no radius above 4px on anything

---

### HERO — 2-col split (55/45), `min-h-screen`

**Grid:** `grid grid-cols-[55fr_45fr] gap-16 px-20 items-center min-h-screen`

**Left column:**
1. Kicker: `font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-text2` — `"01 — FULL-STACK DEVELOPER"`
2. H1: `font-display text-[64px] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-text1` — `"Building scalable web systems where precision meets logic."`
3. Bio: `font-body text-base text-text2 leading-relaxed max-w-md` — 2 lines, realistic copy
4. CTA row: `flex gap-4 mt-8`
   - Filled: `bg-accent text-bg font-mono text-sm px-6 py-3` (no radius)
   - Outlined: `border border-border text-text1 font-mono text-sm px-6 py-3 hover:border-accent`
5. Icon row: GitHub + LinkedIn SVG icons at 24px, `text-text2 hover:text-text1`

**Right column — Terminal card:**
- Container: `bg-surface border border-border p-0 rounded-[4px]`
- Header bar: `flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-3 border-b border-border`
  - macOS dots: 3× `w-3 h-3 rounded-full` in red/yellow/green (`#FF5F57`, `#FFBD2E`, `#28C840`)
  - Tab label: `font-mono text-xs text-text2 ml-2` — `"developer.config.ts"`
- Code body: `p-6 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed`
  - Syntax: keys in `text-text2`, values in `text-accent`, strings in `text-green`, brackets in `text-text1`
  - Content: realistic TypeScript config object — name, role, stack array, availability, timezone

---

### ABOUT — Bento 2-col (60/40)

**Grid:** `grid grid-cols-[60fr_40fr] gap-6 px-20 py-24`

**Left card** (`bg-surface border border-border p-8`):
- Display statement: `font-display text-4xl text-text1 leading-tight mb-6` — philosophy line ("Systems thinking applied to every line of code.")
- Narrative: `font-body text-base text-text2 leading-relaxed mb-8` — 3 sentences
- Pill tags: `flex flex-wrap gap-2` — each pill `border border-border font-mono text-xs text-text2 px-3 py-1 rounded-[4px]`
  - RESTful APIs · Database Architecture · Component Systems · Responsive UI

**Right card** (`bg-surface border border-border p-8 flex flex-col justify-between`):
- Numbered list 01–04: each item `flex gap-4 items-start`
  - Number: `font-mono text-xs text-accent w-6 shrink-0`
  - Label: `font-body text-sm text-text1`
  - Items: Full-Stack Web Dev / API & DB Design / Interactive Frontend / System Performance & Deployment

---

### PROCESS — Compressed Tier 3 (single-row 3-step tracker)

**Layout:** `flex items-start gap-0 px-20 py-16 border-t border-border`

3 steps connected by `flex-1 h-px bg-border mt-3` dividers:

Each step:
- Step number: `font-mono text-xs text-accent mb-2` — `"01"`
- Title: `font-display text-base text-text1`
- Subtitle: `font-mono text-xs text-text2`
  - 01 Requirement Architecture & Schema Design
  - 02 Component & API Construction
  - 03 Production & Deployment

No illustrations, no sub-cards. One row, connects left-to-right.

---

### PROJECTS — 4 alternating cards, `py-24 px-20`

Section header: `font-mono text-xs text-text2 tracking-widest mb-16` — `"02 — SELECTED WORK"`

Each project card: `grid grid-cols-2 gap-16 mb-24 items-center`
- Odd (1, 3): visual left, content right
- Even (2, 4): content left, visual right — achieved via `order-last` / `order-first`

**Visual panel** (`aspect-video bg-surface border border-border relative`):
- Amber corner ticks: `absolute` positioned 1px L-shaped lines at each corner using `before`/`after` pseudo-elements or small absolutely-positioned divs — `w-4 h-4 border-accent border-l-2 border-t-2` (top-left), etc.
- Mono badge: `absolute top-4 right-4 font-mono text-xs text-text2 border border-border px-2 py-1` — `"PROJECT · 01"`
- Inner placeholder: centered `text-text2 font-mono text-xs` — `"[ mockup ]"`

**Content panel:**
1. Counter: `font-mono text-xs text-text2` — `"Project 01 / 04"`
2. Title: `font-display text-3xl text-text1 mt-2 mb-4`
3. Description: `font-body text-base text-text2 leading-relaxed mb-6` — 2 sentences, realistic project desc
4. Tech pills: same pill style as About
5. Buttons: `flex gap-4`
   - Outlined: `border border-border text-text1 font-mono text-xs px-5 py-2.5 hover:border-accent hover:text-accent`
   - Ghost: `text-text2 font-mono text-xs px-5 py-2.5 hover:text-text1`

Projects (realistic): E-Commerce Platform · Real-Time Dashboard · REST API Gateway · Component Library

---

### SKILLS MATRIX — 4-col grid, `py-24 px-20 border-t border-border`

Section header: `font-mono text-xs text-text2 tracking-widest mb-16` — `"03 — TECHNICAL SKILLS"`

**Grid:** `grid grid-cols-4 gap-6`

Each column card (`bg-surface border border-border p-6`):
- Category header: `font-display text-sm text-text1 mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border`
- Per-tool row: `flex items-center justify-between py-2`
  - Tool name: `font-body text-sm text-text1`
  - Proficiency: 3 dots `w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full` — filled = `bg-accent`, empty = `bg-border`
- Divider after header only
- 3–5 tools per column

Columns:
- **Frontend**: React, TypeScript, Next.js, Tailwind CSS, Vite
- **Backend & APIs**: Node.js, Express, GraphQL, REST, tRPC
- **Databases & DevOps**: PostgreSQL, Redis, Docker, AWS, CI/CD
- **Tools & Version Control**: Git, GitHub, Figma, VS Code, Postman

---

### CONTACT / FOOTER — `border-t border-border pt-24 pb-16 px-20`

**Header row:**
- Pulsing green dot: `w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green animate-pulse inline-block mr-3`
- Text: `font-mono text-sm text-text2` — `"Open for new projects & roles"`

**3-card row:** `grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12 mb-24`
Each card (`bg-surface border border-border p-8 hover:border-accent transition-colors cursor-pointer`):
- Icon: 32px SVG (Email, GitHub, LinkedIn) in `text-text1`
- Label: `font-display text-lg text-text1 mt-4 mb-1`
- Sub: `font-mono text-xs text-text2`
- Arrow: `text-text2 hover:text-accent` — `"→"`

**Footer bar:** `flex items-center justify-between border-t border-border pt-8`
- Left: `font-body text-xs text-text2` — `"© 2024 Alex Chen"`
- Center: `font-mono text-xs tracking-widest text-text2 uppercase` — `"FULL-STACK DEVELOPER"`
- Right: GitHub + LinkedIn icons at 20px, `text-text2 hover:text-text1`

---

## Typography Utility Classes (define once in index.css or App-level)

```css
.font-display { font-family: var(--font-display); }
.font-mono    { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
.font-body    { font-family: var(--font-body); }
```

Tailwind v4 maps these via `@theme` font tokens; use `font-display`, `font-mono`, `font-body` as Tailwind classes directly.

---

## Responsive Breakpoint (~1000px)

At `md:` and below:
- Nav: collapse links into hamburger; keep logo + Resume
- Hero: single column, terminal card below H1
- About bento: stack vertically
- Projects: stack visual above content
- Skills: 2-col grid
- Contact: 1-col card stack

---

## 8px Grid Adherence

All spacing values must be multiples of 8px:
- Section padding: `py-24` (96px) or `py-20` (80px)
- Card padding: `p-6` (24px) or `p-8` (32px)
- Gap values: `gap-6` (24px), `gap-16` (64px)
- Nav height: `h-18` (72px)

